==Rules==
{{ColosseumRule|Cooldown Equality}}

==Battleground==
*8 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 5~8 seconds<sup>150f~240f</sup>.
*3 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*1 [[Aku Gory]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Vermilingua Rangmaster]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
**3 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn, delay 66.67~70 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,100f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
**8 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**1 [[Dagshund]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**1 [[Master A.]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**1 [[Rain D.]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
**1 [[Midnite D.]] spawns after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Esoteric Uril]] can help a lot with both damaging and stopping the Aku enemies inside of this stage.
[[Talents|Talented]] [[Awakened Bahamut Cat]] can help greatly in this stage, as his blast can potentially (when other support is used) chain the [[Rain D.]] and [[Midnite D.]]

